  /// (Security handlers of revision 3 or greater) Assemble the document (insert, rotate, or delete pages and create document outline items or thumbnail images), even if bit 4 is clear.
  static const PSPDFDocumentPermissionsAssemble = 64;

  /// The PDF reference states that this permission may be restricted to only allow printing with degraded quality (if the printing permission is also granted). Since iOS only offers a single printing pipeline, restricting this permission has no effect on Nutrient iOS SDK. If the printing permission is granted then printing may always be high quality.
  static const PSPDFDocumentPermissionsPrintHighQuality = 128;
}

